eform channel labels, direct engineering prose and symmetric 30 mm body margins. Full PDF and source integrity, ZIP CRC and member hashes verified.\n\nDownload **Thesis_V1_V2_V3.pdf** for the complete thesis and **Thesis_V1_V2_V3_Source.zip** for all 541 current editable source files. **SHA256SUMS.txt** contains their SHA-256 hashes.\n\nThe tag remains on the original repository reference commit. GitHub's automatic “Source code” archives contain that older checkout; use the attached thesis source ZIP for the current work.\n"}